OL,3,GNEWSAHow unpredictable climate is
OL,4,Achanging parks
OL,5,
OL,6,FIncreasingly unpredictable seasons
OL,7,Fcaused by climate change are reshaping
OL,8,Fhow parks and green spaces should be
OL,9,Fcared for, a council has said.
OL,11,FShrewsbury Town Council said it had
OL,12,Fseen recent rapid grass growth due to
OL,13,Fan "unusually dry summer followed by
OL,14,Fwarm, wet conditions".
OL,16,FThe announcement comes following a
OL,17,Fsummer of extreme heat, with July 2026
OL,18,Fthe driest on record for England and
OL,19,FWales and the Met Office warning it is
OL,20,F"very likely" that 2027 will be the
OL,21,Fhottest year on record globally.
OL,23,APub: 23-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,358,350,200,160,0,100
