OL,3,GNEWSAHow unpredictable climate is
OL,4,Achanging parks
OL,5,
OL,6,F"The weather has given us very
OL,7,Fdifferent conditions to manage this
OL,8,Fyear," said Danny Powell, operations
OL,9,Fmanager of the council's recreation and
OL,10,Fgreen space team.
